but not further.

Some details from the way:

1st Sokoban: BoH
Minetown: coaligned priest and magic lamp from the store (a rub, a wish
and I had myself a +2 GDSM)
Levels: 11-13: all contained altar and a priest (none coaligned)
Lvl 20: altar (where I kept my stash)
Lvl 21: coaligned altar and a priest

So, many altars, but only one store (general) at starting levels, and
another (delicatessen) deep down.

I had lowered AC by donating to priests, but I spoiled that by angering
god (it was either diggin up a grave or accidentally kicking Tyr's
altar (I had typed: "n 15 k [left arrow]" to clean the altar, but there
was one kick too much).

No Fort Ludios.

Shield of reflection and levitation boots from Medusa.

I spent a _long_ time looking for Vlad's Tower stairs, finally finding
them from Baalzebub's Lair, behind a corner in the maze where I
_thought_ I had looked many times.

Getting back was a drag because of the mysterious force, which threw me
